WEBVTT

00:00:27.184 --> 00:00:30.772
a svako malo, loptice se sudare u zraku

00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:32.875
i svi kažu "O!"

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:39.517
Zatim, slučajnim odabirom,
izaberemo partnere i igramo u parovima.

00:00:39.891 --> 00:00:42.780
Ali doista vam ne bih mogao reći
tko je pobijedio,

00:00:42.804 --> 00:00:46.533
jer mijenjamo partnere svakih 5 minuta.

00:00:47.097 --> 00:00:50.582
A svi se jako trude

00:00:50.606 --> 00:00:52.043
da osvoje bodove,

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:56.177
ali nitko ne prati stanje tko pobjeđuje.

00:00:56.992 --> 00:01:01.229
Nakon nekih sat vremena žestokog napora,